%[text:table]
%[text] ### [IntroToCopilot.m](file:Scripts/IntroToCopilot.m)
%[text:table]{"ignoreHeader":true}
%[text] | <p align="center">![](text:image:311f)</p> | <p>**In this script, students will...**</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Learn the primary features of MATLAB and Simulink Copilot </p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Generate code with MATLAB Copilot to solve an engineering problem</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Investigate and analyze a physical model using Simulink Copilot</p> | <p>**Academic disciplines**</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} All Engineering Disciplines</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Artificial Intelligence </p> |
